00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:33.509
strong and it's important to know that I'm
using the term superficially, it is going

00:04:33.509 --> 00:04:37.360
to be a tough uphill battle to knock out Donald
Trump in November.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:43.180
The reality impeachment is that impeachment
was the right thing constitutionally it was

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:48.440
the right thing from the point of view of
this is a responsibility of the house of representatives

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:52.599
to bring impeachment charges when the facts
support them and warrant them.

00:04:52.599 --> 00:04:57.139
The reality is that we have to figure out
a way to win.

00:04:57.139 --> 00:05:03.310
And the other reality is that it is not surprising
or unexpected that polling support for the

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:09.950
president would consolidate as we close in
on the election, particularly if the democratic

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:16.740
party continues to be framed, not totally
inaccurately as inept in its ability to just

