00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.639
So do I, uh, am I giving up?

00:05:30.639 --> 00:05:32.181
Am I suggesting anyone give up?

00:05:32.181 --> 00:05:33.220
Of course not.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.300
Of course not.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:40.590
But what I am telling you is that there are
a real obstacles here to removing Donald Trump.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:45.039
Another one will certainly be that there is
